WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.350
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.620
This never-ending LOOP,

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.840
a cycle that goes out of spin,

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.270
and runs towards you.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.740
Under this bright sunlight,

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.040
and blue sky,

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.540
I’m accelerating so fast that I can’t stop moving.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.690
It’s my first time having these feelings.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.450
What should I do? My throbbing heart doesn’t know,

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:46.590
and keeps searching for the solution, even now.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.720
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.400
I am here because of your kiss,

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.350
which has stopped the flow of time.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.870
I knock on the door to your heart,

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.870
and watch your wavering dreams.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.640
Your RUBY eyes are what absorb me in.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.550
Barely in sight,

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:15.880
the translucent door to your heart looks like it is opening now.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:20.400
Only you...

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.830
my kiss will reach...

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:34.650
Midterms are over now,

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:37.780
so I think we should discuss the production of the movie.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:42.620
First, I think we should hear the plot synopsis I asked Sanada to write up,

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:42.490
Full Length Movie! Film Preparation

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:42.490
Meeting

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:45.450
and bring to light any difficulties the film may meet with.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.620
Sanada, go ahead.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:49.670
Yeah.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:51.840
All right, I was waiting for this!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.670
Mao-neechan...

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.180
Why are you here?

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.800
What?

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.890
You helped me study for the test,

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:04.970
so I thought I'd help you out.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.520
Go on, announce it.

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:13.070
Um, there are still loose ends,

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.690
but in order for everyone to sympathize with the two leads,

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:20.570
I thought that I'd make them both high school students...

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:24.490
The male lead goes to the same school as

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.000
a childhood friend whom he has always liked.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.620
However, the girl had a bad experience

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:33.040
in which she was betrayed by her middle school boyfriend.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:35.920
The male lead is hurt by the cold attitude she projects.

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:40.300
But eventually, the girl realizes her true feelings,

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.640
calls the boy to the beach,

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.180
and confesses to him.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.980
I wanted the ending to have a kind of happy feeling.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.270
It's like a movie!

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:54.610
Well, it <i>is</i> a movie.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.360
It's simple, but quite engrossing.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.780
Sounds good, Sanada.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.950
I think it's pretty good, coming from Kouichi.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:08.200
The truth is, I had Hoshino-san help me come up with the story.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.870
The ideas for the story, the reference books;

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.710
it all came together thanks to Hoshino-san.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.340
I only helped out a little.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:20.880
Good going.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.510
I see, love brought it all together.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:29.270
Ah, no, I'm just saying that it wasn't only me who thought of it.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.150
What's this?

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.610
They're getting along pretty well.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:42.570
You're showing off so boldly. Ah, I'm so jealous!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:41.570
I guess he won't always be my little brother, huh?

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.280
Aside from that, the story is fine.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.030
The real problem is...

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.040
Damn it.

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.630
Can't we stay for a little bit?

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.710
What was with that strict teacher?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:03.220
Hey, what are you all doing?

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.760
The time to leave was quite a while ago.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.010
He didn't have to kick us out.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.970
Besides, that head of his is suspicious...

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.430
It's a wig, I tell you.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.020
Calm down, Mao-neechan.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:13.730
This looks suspicious

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.480
It can't be helped, we're the ones who just used that room.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:20.860
It's a sad plot against like-minded people such as us.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.240
I'll expose it one day!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.030
Onii-chan!

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.700
You're going home now?

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:27.910
You sure are late.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:32.410
Note: Dashi is a kind of cooking stock made from kelp and dried tuna.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:32.410
Naru and I were researching how to prepare delicious udon dashi.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:34.790
We were kicked out by a teacher, though.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.040
You girls too?

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.540
Let's continue at the store.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.920
Yeah, sounds good.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.420
Store?

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:44.300
Do you two have a favorite store?

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:49.100
Um, rather than a favorite store...

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.430
If you'd like, how about coming along with us?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.270
Satonaka Udon

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.400
Grandpa!

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.570
I brought some customers!

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.070
So, this is Narumi-chan's home?

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:13.870
My seniors from the Movie Research Club are looking for a place to hold meetings.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:22.210
H-Hello!

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:24.260
The store opens up at five, right?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.510
Can they stay while we're preparing?

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.110
It's good!

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:44.610
Delicious!

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:45.900
Yeah, it's good.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:48.450
This dashi is quite something.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.830
Thank you for treating us!

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.790
It's really delicious!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:00.080
We have permission to hold meetings while they're preparing,

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.040
so we're saved.

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:04.840
I'm going to order udon every time we come!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:10.090
My grandpa's udon is the best in Japan!

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.890
You want to become an udon chef too, right, Naru-chan?

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:17.140
Yeah, I want to hurry up and become good so I can help my grandpa.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:21.440
Ah, so that's why you created an Udon Association.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:25.280
Yes. I don't want to just inherit my grandpa's recipes,

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.570
but also to create an original menu.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:29.910
That's why I have to research now!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.870
You're thinking about the future already.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:38.460
Your dream for the future is to become a novelist, right?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.580
You don't need to bring that up here.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.670
You're hoping to become a novelist, Sanada-kun?

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:50.680
Yeah. Well, no, I'm not seriously trying to become one or anything.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.550
Geez.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:56.060
Kouichi's determined face back then,

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:00.020
you just can't forget it, right, Kazuki?

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.900
Yeah, he was serious that time.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.570
What's wrong, Kouichi?

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.990
Because... because...!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.530
Nello...

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.830
 Note: He is referring to the book <i>A Dog of Flanders</i> by Marie Louise de la Ramee.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:18.830
Nello and Patrache died!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:26.460
"I'll become a novelist and bring happiness to Nello!"

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:26.960
...is what he said.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.460
How cute!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.420
That was moving!

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.840
As expected from you, Sanada.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.180
Why'd it turn out like this?

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.220
Since then, Kouichi has...

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.890
started to hate <i>The Dog of Flanders</i>, though.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:46.360
Just looking at the art on the book cover brings tears to his eyes.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.780
I said that's enough...

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:51.610
What's with that face? It's a good story.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:52.990
It's just like you.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.820
What kind of character am I supposed to be?

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:57.410
<i>That</i> kind of character.

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.240
Right?

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:14.130
Continuing from before, about the lead couple...

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:17.300
leaving aside that the male lead will be played by one of us three,

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.560
the problem is who to ask to play the female lead.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:26.480
For love stories, the heroine's charm influences the film.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.530
Wouldn't Mao-neechan be fine then?

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.730
Eh? Me?!

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.320
W-Why?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:35.860
Ah, well, you seem to be familiar with love scenes.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:37.700
You just came back from France, after all.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.500
What kind of image of France do you have?!

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.160
Country of Love

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.120
How about you try it out?

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.380
I said that I'd help...

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.170
but acting is kind of impossible.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:54.010
Costume design would be interesting, though.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.880
How about you play it, Yuumi-chan?

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:56.180
Eh?!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:59.640
That's right. You can do that in addition to helping out with the screenplay.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.520
I-I can't! It's impossible!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.520
I can't act!

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.190
Just the reaction I expected.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.610
Well then, Nana, you do it.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.020
"Well then"?

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.950
I'm helping Naru-chan make udon,

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.410
so I can't do it!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.370
What are we going to do?

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.830
I guess we'll have to go scouting.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:25.290
We'll split up and search for a charming heroine that'll look good on the silver screen.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:28.710
We have to go invite people again?

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:37.680
Men shouldn't wear piercings!

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.470
It's against school regulations.

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.720
Which year and class are you in?

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:44.980
What's your name?

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:46.850
I guess she won't work.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:50.810
Okay!

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.530
Let's finish up morning practice.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:56.490
Y-Yeah.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.360
I'll go return the ball then.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.660
Ah, Sakino!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.080
Would you be willing to...

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:08.210
Forget it.

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:09.670
What is it?

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:12.460
I'm looking for a quality, charming person.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:17.840
But now that I think about it, you're not fit for a love story-type role.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:22.260
You'd be perfect for athletic roles, though.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.350
Hey, Tomo-chan, please!

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:30.400
Mizusawa-san, I told you to stop calling me that, haven't I?

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:32.060
Ah, I see.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.570
Kawada-sensei, please help us!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:39.450
Everyone in the class is busy studying.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:42.370
Think of it as helping out as the Movie Research Club advisor.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:44.950
I'd like to help out, but...

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.620
taking on the role of a high school girl is pushing it a bit.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:51.380
Pushing it a bit?

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.590
A-Anyways, I'm sorry, but ask some other people, okay?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.220
Good morning.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.090
Morning.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:08.100
So, that's why I'm also helping to look for a heroine.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:11.060
Do you have anyone in mind, Kai-kun?

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.270
Someone who matches the charming heroine role.

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.030
No, no one.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:20.450
I see...

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:22.700
I guess that's how it is.

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:27.240
If it's come to this, I guess I'll have to go around to the first year classes.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.160
Mizusawa...

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.080
are you coming to the store today?

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.550
Yeah, I was planning to.

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.070
Um...

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:02.530
Is this part of-

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.320
Be quiet.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:04.570
Yes.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:10.410
Her hand sure is small.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.370
She's short after all.

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:17.090
It looks like she would break if I hugged her.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:22.340
Hug her? What am I thinking?

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.600
Could it be...?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:32.680
Ki-

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:33.810
It hurts.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:36.230
My hand.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.480
S-Sorry.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:42.740
The experiment today is a success.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:43.530
Eh?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.610
I was able to demonstrate it.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:51.080
This is, without doubt, a process that does not lead to the impulse to kiss.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:55.330
It was passive, but it's a step forward.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.580
I see.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.000
You're going to drink coffee, right?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.300
Eh? Ah, no...

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:06.220
Yes.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.180
Hey, Futami-san...

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.890
Are you willing to be in a... movie?

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.100
No.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.110
Ah, I see.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:20.980
That's that.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:27.740
Here you go.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.740
Ah, thank you.

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:34.450
She says that it's coffee but...

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.460
This is...

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:51.100
What are you putting on them?

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:52.760
Can't you tell from looking?

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.310
Mayonnaise and honey?

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:57.890
Yes.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.520
Um, what kind of experiment is that?

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.070
Experiment?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.030
What is?

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.030
Ah, that.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:07.900
It's my lunch.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.990
It's good like this.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:12.830
Wow, is she serious?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.370
Can I have one?

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:25.050
It's Bad After All

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:26.970
Could it be you have bad taste, Futami-san?

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:28.720
Me?

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.050
By all means, it's normal.

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.010
No, it's definitely not normal!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.850
There's no way you can eat chips with all that!

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.640
That's quite arrogant of you.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.400
Are you saying your taste is accurate?

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:45.530
At the very least, it's better than yours.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:49.530
Haven't you ever been told by someone that you have weird tastes?

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:50.700
Never.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.240
Because I always eat alone.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.000
I see.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.160
That's why she doesn't realize it.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.880
I thought she was a perfect person, but...

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.420
it seems that I've discovered an unexpected side of her.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.340
Then how about we conduct an experiment?

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:11.180
Experiment?

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:15.850
There's an old, infamous ramen restaurant in front of the train station.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:19.480
We'll eat their famous dish there, and after tasting it properly,

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.230
we'll confirm whether you have no taste or not.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:26.530
Fine.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.740
I'll prove that my taste is accurate.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.950
I thought she would refuse.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:40.330
But, could this be...

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:42.960
A date?

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.970
No luck with 2-B either.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.680
This is bad.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.680
I can't expect much from Aihara and Sanada.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:05.690
Music Room

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.080
Hoshino-san, do you have a break from library duty?

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.920
I was on duty during lunch.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.340
Then, if you'd like...

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.300
Do you want to go home together?

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:33.470
Yes.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:36.890
Huh?

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:38.760
It's Mao-neechan.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.140
Is that someone from her class?

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:45.400
She has been going out a lot lately too. Could that person be...

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.610
Mizusawa-senpai?

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.240
Well, let's go.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:52.900
Sure.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:57.700
Hiiragi?

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.450
Hiiragi Akira

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.450
Meeting

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.450
I found a heroine.
Meet up at Satonaka's.

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:01.750
I had Soccer Club today.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:05.290
Research Movie Club, soccer and experiments...

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.460
I'm becoming quite the busy guy!

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.380
You found a heroine!

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:17.430
What kind of person is she?

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.470
We don't know who it is yet.

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:23.350
It's kind of exciting, isn't it?

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.430
Yeah, you're right.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.020
Greetings everyone, sorry for the wait.

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:30.150
Please, come in.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.110
Okay.

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.990
My name is Shijou Mitsuki.

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:40.030
Nice to meet you all.

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.120
Shijou-san?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.210
That super high-class lady?

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:45.910
Y-Yeah.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:50.670
Wow! It's the person who was in that amazing car!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:55.880
Actually, I met Shijou-san by chance while I was in the music room.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:18:00.100
After I explained the situation, she gave an enthusiastic okay.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.680
U-Um, will you really play the role?

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:04.520
Yes.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:09.150
I'm learning many things,

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.520
so I can't participate in normal clubs.

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:16.780
If you're available during the periods I'm free, please allow me to help out.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.200
What kind of things do you learn?

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:22.080
Piano, flower arrangement, and a bit of ballet.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.040
If you've done ballet, you can act in front of people!

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:28.870
I don't know how much I can do, and I don't have much confidence, but...

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.130
I'll do my best.

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:33.750
Well done, Hiiragi!

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.320
Hiiragi Akira

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.320
Meeting

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.320
I found a heroine.
Meet up at Satonaka's.

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:57.280
What is it?

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.780
No, it's nothing.

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:06.240
I'm truly sorry!

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:08.460
I thought so.

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:10.920
I knew it was too good to be true.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.170
Truthfully, me too.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:13.630
You...

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:17.420
You have a fiancé, Shijou-senpai?!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:18.510
Yes.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.970
When I was young, it was decided by our families.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:26.510
So, I can't play the heroine in a love story.

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.480
I have to think of the others' stance.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:32.520
We can't do it without a love scene.

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.940
It can't be helped then, let's give up.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.780
We won't have a kiss scene in our movie.

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:38.650
Eh?

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.940
A kiss scene?

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:40.820
Really?

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.860
When did we decide that?

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.910
What are you saying?

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:48.290
There aren't any romance movies without a kiss scene.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.460
Are you an idiot?!

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:52.790
Who's going to do the kiss scene?!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.840
Finding a person who could do it is a scout's skill.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:00.470
Um, I'm truly sorry!

00:20:00.470 --> 00:20:04.260
If there's anything other than the role of the heroine, I'll help!

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:08.680
Yeah, thanks.

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:10.770
We're counting on you.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:13.810
Yes.

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.570
It's on the house, grandpa's treat!

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.530
Thank you for treating us all the time.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:22.530
This is delicious.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:23.450
Isn't it?

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.780
My grandpa's udon is the best in Japan!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.910
I'll let my chef have a taste next time.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:36.670
What? It didn't work out?

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.170
I wonder if everyone is still at Satonaka's.

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.140
Excuse us.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.310
All right, thanks.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:53.940
Thanks!

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:58.110
I feel kind of bad for just sitting.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:01.230
It's natural, since you're a customer.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.610
Yeah, but...

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:05.530
Was it boring?

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:09.280
No, just listening to the performances is fun.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:13.330
I was just wondering if I was interfering with your job.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.210
Not at all.

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:17.330
I'd like you to come tomorrow too...

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:19.750
And after that, always.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:25.340
Just being there is fine.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:27.840
Kai-kun?

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:29.850
Mizusawa...

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.890
kowaresou de

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.890
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.860
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.860
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:41.570
wasarenai yo

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:41.570
I won’t forget

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:47.320
hoshi ni negai o

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:47.320
that wish upon a star.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:47.110
I...!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:22:00.040
kyou shitsu no sumi ni wa itsumo fushigi bako

00:21:55.540 --> 00:22:00.040
The strange box lying in the corner of the classroom;

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:02.420
dare ni mo misenai shi

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:02.420
I won’t show it to anyone.

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:05.220
itsumo minai furi

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:05.220
I always pretend not to see it.

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:11.140
hajimete okutte moratta hoshi no yoru

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:11.140
The first time you walked me home during that starry night.

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:13.520
ano kajitsu mo

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:13.520
The fruit

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:16.100
mada tabetenai kedo

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:16.100
I have not eaten.

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:18.940
honki de butsukatta

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:18.940
I struck it with all my might.

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:21.730
naite sawaida

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:21.730
I cried and I screamed.

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:30.240
shinkei wa kitto kinui totokoutetsu de dekiteta

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:30.240
I’m certain nerves are made from silk and steel.

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:32.870
osaekirenai

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:32.870
My insuppressible feelings

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.870
omoi o nagete negai boshi ni

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.870
are cast on a wishing star.

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:38.500
ima kakeru yo

00:22:37.120 --> 00:22:38.500
It’s now time to run.

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:41.920
tobira no soto wa DAIAMONDO

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:41.920
Beyond the door are diamonds.

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:47.880
ikusen no yume kaki utsushita NOOTO ni

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:47.880
Thousands of dreams transcribed onto a notebook.

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.970
tojikometara ai ni yuku yo

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.970
Whenever I’m trapped I’m go see you.

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:58.940
kirakira toeien o kiritotta mamade

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:58.940
The sparkle and eternity are cut short.

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:03.900
yakusoku shita kimi to nara ano hi no KISU o

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:03.900
We made a promise with a kiss on that day.

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:05.940
kowaresou de

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:05.940
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:09.900
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:09.900
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:12.990
wasurenai yo

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:12.990
I won’t forget

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:18.960
hoshi ni negai o

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:18.960
that wish upon a star.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:39.980
Next Episode

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:27.130
Is a kiss the beginning of love?

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:30.130
Or does a kiss mean that you have attained love?

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:33.850
It looks like it will be a while before I find the answers to my experiment.

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:35.640
Bad taste?

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:37.930
You sure worry about trifling things.
